rq3-transfer-map: the final policy family (train-v5-cmix s0-s4, trained on B2) under every measured drift.
edge = % window tardiness vs MDD-PTECT held, pooled (< 0 better; family = per-instance mean of 5 seeds); 95% seed-bootstrap CI, ** = excludes 0; retention = edge / B2 edge (twin family, paired bootstrap); gap = vs the condition's best v5 pair (in-sample).

