## All twin conditions (T15 family, B2 excluded): does the edge fall with how far the rule landscape moved?
- edge vs shift_tau: Spearman rho +0.19 (p 0.23, 42 conditions)
- edge vs shift_l1: Spearman rho +0.37 (p 0.015, 42 conditions)
- without the floor-size axis, edge vs shift_tau: rho +0.33 (p 0.054, 34 conditions)
- without the floor-size axis, edge vs shift_l1: rho +0.43 (p 0.01, 34 conditions)

